0" end="00:11.520">everything</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.730" end="00:13.950"><span begin="00:11.730" end="00:12.030">And </span><span begin="00:12.030" end="00:12.180">I </span><span begin="00:12.180" end="00:12.600">can't </span><span begin="00:12.600" end="00:12.990">deal </span><span begin="00:12.990" end="00:13.200">with </span><span begin="00:13.200" end="00:13.950">that</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.010" end="00:16.950"><span begin="00:14.010" end="00:14.340">I </span><span begin="00:14.340" end="00:14.880">try </span><span begin="00:14.880" end="00:15.000">to </span><span begin="00:15.000" end="00:15.450">see </span><span begin="00:15.450" end="00:15.810">the </span><span begin="00:15.810" end="00:16.350">good </span><span begin="00:16.350" end="00:16.470">in </span><span begin="00:16.470" end="00:16.950">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.070" end="00:20.460"><span begin="00:17.070" end="00:17.280">But </span><span begin="00:17.280" end="00:17.700">good </span><span begin="00:17.700" end="00:18.210">things </span><span begin="00:18.210" end="00:18.330">in </span><span begin="00:18.330" end="00:18.840">life </span><span begin="00:18.840" end="00:19.170">are </span><span begin="00:19.170" end="00:19.590">hard </span><span begin="00:19.590" end="00:19.680">to </span><span begin="00:19.680" end="00:20.460">find</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.820" end="00:24.120"><span begin="00:20.820" end="00:20.940">We'll </span><span begin="00:20.940" end="00:21.420">blow </span><span begin="00:21.420" end="00:21.510">it </span><span begin="00:21.510" end="00:22.590">away </span><span begin="00:22.590" end="00:23.100">blow </span><span begin="00:23.100" end="00:23.160">it </span><span begin="00:23.160" end="00:24.120">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.390" end="00:30.180"><span begin="00:24.390" end="00:24.750">Can </span><span begin="00:24.750" end="00:24.870">we </span><span begin="00:24.870" end="00:25.380">make </